-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code and data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The license above covers the code written for this project. It does not
relicense material that originates elsewhere:

* Baseline reimplementations. The retrieval pipeline and the baselines
  (HippoRAG 2, RRF, MoR, the LTRR-style ranker, R3AG, RouterRetriever, and the
  prompts they rely on) are reimplementations of previously published methods.
  They may reuse literal portions of the original authors' released code and
  prompts. Those portions remain the work of their respective authors and stay
  under the licenses of the original releases; we gratefully acknowledge them.

* Data. The files under dataset/ and the per-retriever results are derived
  from Natural Questions, HotpotQA, MuSiQue and 2WikiMultihopQA and are
  redistributed under the licenses of those datasets.

* Models. Model weights are not distributed with this repository and are
  subject to the licenses of their providers.
